[{:name "preflight-file-elaboration-before-sorry-accounting-or-runner-dispatch"
  :lane :trajectory-lane
  :level :verification-rule
  :status :draft
  :body
  {:hook
   "A sorry queue is not actionable until the exact target file elaborates: otherwise the runner is debugging the statement surface or build state rather than discharging a proof hole."
   :how-to-apply
   ["Run `lake env lean <target-file>` before computing the proof-hole baseline or dispatching a prover."
    "If elaboration fails, classify the first failure before inspecting any `sorry`: ill-typed statement, stale notation/API, domain/measure mismatch, missing import, or unavailable compiled dependency."
    "When the failure may be a missing dependency artifact, build the named dependency or module and rerun the exact same file before calling the source defective."
    "Only after the file elaborates should the queue record direct proof holes, declaration types, and the runner target."
    "Keep repairs that change mathematical meaning—such as replacing an ill-typed Borel-set predicate with a measurable-set predicate—behind owner review rather than treating them as compilation maintenance."]
   :observed-case
   {:problem "a01J02"
    :failures
    ["`B ∈ borel ℝ` applies set-membership notation to a measurable-space value."
     "A subtype-domain function is paired with a measure on `ℝ`."
     "The symmetric-difference statement uses stale scope/API assumptions."]
    :semantic-risk
    "The literal repair makes the conclusions reflexive, while the intended completion theorem needs `NullMeasurableSet` and `AEMeasurable`; compilation repair therefore requires a mathematical choice."}
   :rule
   "Treat successful elaboration of the exact target under its real project build as a precondition for proof-hole measurement and runner dispatch, and separate dependency-build failures from source-statement failures by rerunning after the dependency is built."
   :boundary
   "This preflight detects whether a row is formally runnable. It does not decide which semantic repair is faithful when an ill-typed statement admits several interpretations."
   :capture-kind :runner-elaboration-diagnosis-and-owner-verified-repair-fork}
